workers/dist/

# bundled MCP server artifact (built fresh via scripts/build-mcp-screenshot.mjs;
# users run `npm run build:mcp-screenshot` once before `claude mcp add`)
dist/

# local agent/lint caches + throwaway session screenshots (not committed)
.agents/
.claudelint-cache/
/t2.1-*.png

# this repo's own insights log — untracked 2026-08-12. A session hook appends to
# it on nearly every turn, so it dirtied the tree constantly and needed its own
# chore: commit or a place in an unrelated PR. Applies to THIS repo only, not to
# the guidance Minder gives other projects.
#
# ANY OTHER CHECKOUT LOSES ITS COPY when it pulls past this commit — an ignore
# rule does not protect an already-tracked file, and git applies the deletion.
# Measured, both ways: a clean file is removed silently; a file with uncommitted
# entries aborts the merge instead, so unversioned work is never destroyed.
# Restore with:  git show 64bae04:INSIGHTS.md > INSIGHTS.md
# Entries through 64bae04 live in history; only later ones are unversioned.
/INSIGHTS.md
